stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Empty
  Empty --> Loaded: parse .rot file
  Loaded --> Validated: sort by age, check bounds
  Validated --> Queryable
  Queryable --> Interpolating: rotation_at(age)
  Interpolating --> Queryable: slerp result
  Interpolating --> OutOfRange: age beyond samples
  OutOfRange --> Queryable: caller handles error
  Queryable --> [*]
